&nbsp;I would specify that I mean the ones you like playing as, not necessarily which ones are better.&nbsp;

[/quote]

Sure, there been plenty of debate on which are better, this is completely personal opinion on fun. &nbsp;So here is who I have fun with

&nbsp;

Super fun (in no order): With rare exception I always really enjoy these guys.

Nightmist, Argent Adept, Wraith, Tachyon, Chrono Ranger

&nbsp;

Very fun:

Unity, Tempest, Haka, Ra, Fanatic, Absolute Zero, Scholar, Omni-X, Visionary

&nbsp;

 Still Ok: 

Expatriette, Mr. Fixer, Legacy, Bunker

&nbsp;

The last four are really the only ones I don&#39;t have too much fun playing which is why I always want to fiddle with them. I&#39;ve tried several base power changes for Ex and Fixer with mixed success. &nbsp; For Bunker my current idea is to have the Mode cards changed to say that you can return them to hand instead of destroy them at the start of your turn.
